WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.290
Last night you dreamed you
were running for a train.

2
00:00:03.340 --> 00:00:06.760
The doors slid shut, and
it pulled away without you.

3
00:00:06.810 --> 00:00:08.990
Odd, but harmless.

4
00:00:09.040 --> 00:00:10.150
Or is it?

5
00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:12.860
Beneath the dream sits a locked box.

6
00:00:12.910 --> 00:00:15.520
Freud claimed every dream fulfils a wish,

7
00:00:15.570 --> 00:00:17.380
but in disguise.

8
00:00:17.430 --> 00:00:20.810
A disguise only makes sense
if someone is being fooled.

9
00:00:20.860 --> 00:00:23.710
So who is the dream hiding the wish from?

10
00:00:23.760 --> 00:00:27.800
In this mission, you'll explore
Freud's idea of the unconscious mind,

11
00:00:27.850 --> 00:00:30.890
and find out what kind of
wishes he thought it holds.

12
00:00:30.940 --> 00:00:33.600
And you'll split a dream into two layers:

13
00:00:33.650 --> 00:00:37.310
the story you remember, and
the hidden meaning underneath.

14
00:00:37.360 --> 00:00:41.170
Your mission: find out who Freud
thought the disguise was for.
